Package: HMMclone
Title: Hidden Markov Model for Copy Number Inference in Clones
Version: 0.0.1
Authors@R: 
    person("Marc", "Williams", email = "marcjwilliams1@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Infer integer copy number profiles from pseudobulk clones derived 
    from sparse single-cell whole genome sequencing (scWGS) data. Uses a Hidden 
    Markov Model (HMM) to segment the genome and call copy number states across 
    chromosomes.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
